# ── Anthropic ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional server-side key. When unset, users paste their own key in the UI.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Model used only when an /api/generate request omits `model`. The UI always
# sends the model picked in the selector, so leave this unset unless you call
# the API directly. Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-6.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# ── App ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# App version is read from package.json at build time — bump it there.

# ── Sentry (not active yet) ──────────────────────────────────────
# sentry.*.config.ts exist but are not loaded: Next 14 needs
# experimental.instrumentationHook for the server config, and the browser
# config needs withSentryConfig in next.config.mjs. Setting these alone
# does nothing until that wiring is added.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://xxx@oN.ingest.sentry.io/yyy
# SENTRY_DSN=https://xxx@oN.ingest.sentry.io/yyy  # server-only fallback

# ── Dropbox (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing to configure. Dropbox access tokens are entered per-user in the
# UI and live in sessionStorage only — see "Dropbox Setup" in the README.
